OL,3,GNEWSAAboriginal artefacts returned by  
OL,4,AUniversity of Aberdeen                 
OL,6,FAboriginal artefacts collected almost  
OL,7,F100 years ago in Australia have been   
OL,8,Freturned by the University of Aberdeen.
OL,10,FAnthropologist Dr Ralph Piddington     
OL,11,Fcollected the objects in 1930 and 1931 
OL,12,Fwhen he was researching in Western     
OL,13,FAustralia while studying at the        
OL,14,FUniversity of Sydney.                  
OL,16,FThe traditional shields, digging sticks
OL,17,Fand sacred men's objects were later    
OL,18,Fbrought to Scotland, but have now been 
OL,19,Freturned to the Karajarri people.      
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
