OL,3,GNEWSAAboriginal artefacts returned by  
OL,4,AUniversity of Aberdeen                 
OL,6,FThe university said there was no       
OL,7,Fevidence to suggest the items had been 
OL,8,Fobtained unethically, but their return 
OL,9,Freflected a "shared understanding" they
OL,10,Fshould be held by the Karajarri        
OL,11,Fcommunity.                             
